# Rushing Beat Shura - Japanese Font Table
# Rebuilt 2026-05-16 from FONT ground truth (fonts/jp_font_p0.bin / p1.bin).
# Old table had multiple skipped entries causing systematic substitution
# errors (ば↔ど, ズ↔ゼ, 多↔助, 策↔薬, クルムビガハ vs クルムバッハ, etc.).
#
# Format: hex=character
# Page 1 characters (direct byte values $00-$F6)
# Page 2 characters use FA prefix (FA00, FA01, etc.)
#
# Control codes:
# F7=end of text line (+ 1 param byte)
# F8=text speed (+ 1 param byte)
# F9=portrait (+ 1 param byte)
# FA=page 2 char (+ 1 char byte)
# FB=window type (+ 1 param byte)
# FC=control (+ 2-3 param bytes)
# FD=newline
# FE=page break
# FF=end of block
#
# === Hiragana ($00-$2D) ===
